<title>USA: Bank of New York increases quarterly payout.</title>
<headline>Bank of New York increases quarterly payout.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of New York Co Inc said Tuesday that its board has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.24 per share, up from $0.22 per share.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend is payable February 6 to holders of record January 24.</p>
</text>
